---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base
  title="Contact GovRemoteJobs"
  description="Get in touch with GovRemoteJobs."
>
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p style="max-width:640px;color:var(--muted);">Questions, feedback, or something look wrong on a listing? Reach us at:</p>
  <p style="margin-top:0.75rem;"><a class="btn" href="mailto:contact@govremotejobs.com">contact@govremotejobs.com</a></p>

  <div class="card" style="margin-top:2rem;max-width:640px;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;">A few things we can't help with</h2>
    <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
      <li><strong>Applications</strong> — we don't process applications or forward resumes. Use the "Apply" link on the job page to go to the original posting.</li>
      <li><strong>Application status</strong> — we have no visibility into any employer's hiring process. Contact the employer or agency directly.</li>
      <li><strong>Removed/closed listings</strong> — these come down automatically once a job closes on its official source. If something looks stale, let us know and we'll check the source.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
